CCTPBridgeModule_RemoveDomainConfig
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when domain is not configured
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_DomainNotConfigured
└── given domain is configured
    ├── it should delete the domain config
    ├── it should set isValid to false
    └── it should emit DomainConfigRemoved
